WEBVTT

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.460
This year's team uniforms are ready.

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:08.690
Uniforms?!

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.320
It looks even cooler than last year's!

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:13.400
Our manager's really evolving!

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.450
Seriously outta sight!

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.700
What are you talking about?

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.540
The manager designs our uniforms.

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:21.720
What?

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:24.040
You're amazing, Kurikoma-senpai!

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:25.380
All right, let's get to it!

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:25.900
Yah!

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.790
I'm all fired up!

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.410
Er, guys...

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:32.240
There's a lady in the room.

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:38.930
No, by all means, continue.

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:41.440
Come on...

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.480
Not worth all the fuss...

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.600
Y-Yah...

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:50.190
<i>The training camp is over,
 and prefecturals are in five days.</i>

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:54.860
<b>Final run-through
practice</b>

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:54.860
<b>Sun\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hMon\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hTue\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWed\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hThu\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFri\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hSat</b>

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:54.860
<b>One week left!
Make every
day count!</b>

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:54.860
<b>Focus on fingertips!</b>

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:54.860
<b>Better than yesterday!</b>

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:54.860
<b>Training all week @ Sekiou University gym</b>

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:56.030
<i>I'll compete as a member of 
Ao High's rhythmic gymnastics team.</i>

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:56.030
<b>Prefectural Tournament</b>

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:26.000
<b><i>Backflip!!</i></b>

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:34.240
Shichigahama-senpai's 
knees are looking better.

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:39.080
Yup. Tsukidate-kun is keeping 
his arms straighter, too.

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:51.850
Tsukidate-kun, keep your passes in sync.

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:52.850
Sir.

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:55.420
Onagawa-kun, legs together 
on the first pass.

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:56.490
Sir!

00:02:56.490 --> 00:02:59.110
Watari-kun, keep those limbs fluid.

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.390
Yah!

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:01.250
Futaba-kun.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:02.360
S-Sir!

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:05.300
Relax out there.

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:07.140
Yes, sir!

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:24.920
Shotaro-kun always messes up the handstand.

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:27.340
He can do the handstand just fine,

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:30.640
yet seems to struggle 
with it as part of a routine.

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:32.560
Shotaro.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:37.230
Your legs are wandering 
during the balance element.

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:39.240
Seize the floor with your fingers.

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:42.990
R-Right. Thanks.

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:45.140
Gather around, everyone.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.250
<b>Final run-through
practice</b>

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.250
<b>

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.250
<b>Focus on fingertips!</b></b>

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.250
<b>Better than yesterday!</b>

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.250
<b>Keep handstand steady!</b>

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.250
<b>Training all week @ Sekiou University gym</b>

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.250
<b>Prefectural
Tournament</b>

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.850
<b>Keep handstand steady!</b>

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.850
<b>Better than yesterday!</b>

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.850
<b>Training all week @ Sekiou University gym</b>

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:28.830
<b>Training all week @ Sekiou University gym</b>

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:28.830
<b>Final run-through
practice</b>

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:28.830
<b>Keep handstand steady!</b>

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:28.830
<b>Fewer mistakes!</b>

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:28.830
<b>Avoid injuries</b>

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.660
<b>Final run-through practice{21}
<i>Soar high!!!</i></b>

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:07.660
The prefectural tournament is tomorrow.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:10.680
Let's call it early today.

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:12.450
Get yourselves some rest, okay?

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:15.000
Yes, sir! Thank you!

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:20.130
Headed straight home like always,

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:22.130
Insta-Bail Ace?

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.370
Don't call me that.

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:26.160
Join us, then.

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:27.430
For what?

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:30.430
It'll only take a minute.

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:33.280
But it'll be a very enriching minute indeed!

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:36.310
Ta-dah!

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:39.910
It's from my father, 
to encourage our victory.

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:41.230
And the gyoza?

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:43.200
A gift from my pops.

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:45.380
Watari's family makes damn tasty gyoza!

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:46.900
We've got sasakama, too!

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:50.720
Today's a new flavor: katsu sandwich!

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:54.160
The Sasashichi business 
loves developing new flavors.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.700
And these are....

00:05:56.210 --> 00:06:01.340
<b>Kumano Shrine</b>

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:59.090
Talismans from my father.

00:05:59.090 --> 00:06:01.090
Don't use 'em like chopstick rests!

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:04.770
All your family support is truly appreciated.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:06.480
Now, let us eat.

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:07.890
Thank you for the food.

00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:09.090
Thank you for the food!

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.060
Chili oil! Chili oil!

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:14.050
This fish is good!

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:17.460
Don't let it get to you, Shotaro.

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.900
You're thinkin' about your handstand.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.520
It's okay if you whiff it,

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:26.670
'cause the rest of us
are totally gonna nail it.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:31.780
You sometimes lose your balance in the
 handstand as well, Onagawa-senpai.

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:34.120
Did you think nobody noticed?

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:35.630
We all see it.

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:36.900
Lay off!

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:39.680
I was tryin' to be nice to Shotaro!

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:44.420
None of us expect much 
of a newcomer like you.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.370
"So just relax and do your best."

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:51.340
That's what you're 
trying to say, right, Misato?

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:53.660
Still the Inarticulate Ace.

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:55.670
Don't call me that.

00:06:55.670 --> 00:07:01.080
When it was just the three of us, 
we couldn't even enter the tournament.

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:03.920
Last year we had four,

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.190
which was an automatic three-point deduction.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:09.570
We're just happy to avoid that this year.

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:10.990
So don't sweat it!

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:13.660
Just soar your ass off tomorrow!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:15.410
R-Right!

00:07:15.820 --> 00:07:19.660
It really feels like an 
accomplishment, doesn't it?

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:24.880
I never thought it'd take us three years.

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:27.250
But we made it.

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:33.720
You kept your promise to us, Coach...

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:31.630
<b>Men's
Rhythmic
Gymnastics
Club</b>

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.130
<b>Men's
Rhythmic
Gymnastics
Club</b>

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:36.160
That you'd make this team.

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:39.700
That you'd make a place for us to belong.

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:47.110
Now it's our turn to keep our word.

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:51.350
I promise we'll take you to the Inter-High.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:53.860
I can't wait.

00:07:56.770 --> 00:07:59.120
<i>Oh, that's right...</i>

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:00.700
Captain!

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.470
Tsukidate-senpai! Onagawa-senpai!

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:04.920
What the heck, Watari?

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:09.390
I, Kotaro Watari, shall humbly 
accompany you to the Inter-High!

00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:11.240
I'll be there to the bitter end,

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:13.050
even if it breaks my arms!

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.970
It can break my legs, too!

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:18.530
And it won't just be me, either!

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.960
Shotaro and Misato, too...

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.630
Why are you crying?

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:25.660
Watari, you're scaring them.

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:26.670
Wait, <i>you're</i> crying?

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.190
<i>That</i> made you cry?!

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:32.300
Shotaro, Misato! Let's give this our all!

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:32.300
I ain't cryin'!

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:38.320
I'll kill 'im!

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:55.440
Tsukidate.

00:08:57.590 --> 00:09:00.220
We're about to do this.

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:03.890
We are, Shichigahama.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:19.530
<b>Men's
Rhythmic
Gymnastics
Club</b>

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:23.830
<b>Go team!
Prefectural Tournament</b>

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:56.160
Sorry I can't cheer you on today.

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:58.490
You've got work, right? I know how it goes.

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:03.720
I've never seen you with 
a talisman before, Ryo-chan.

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:10.000
I just really want to make it
 to the Inter-High.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:12.760
Go for it!

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:24.140
Good morning, Coach!

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:27.660
Good morning.

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:31.020
Okay, let's go.

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:32.760
Yes, sir!

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:37.400
Sure are lotsa people here.

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:40.540
It says there are six schools 
participating today.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.450
<b>71st Miyagi Prefecture Inter-High Tournament</b>

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:43.950
The top two will move on to the 
Tohoku Regional Tournament.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:46.010
When's Sho-chan's team going on?

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:47.740
Ao High is...

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:49.310
They're going last!

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:52.090
Last, huh? I'm so nervous!

00:10:52.090 --> 00:10:55.080
It's not like you're going out there, Dad.

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:56.960
<i>We will now begin the opening ceremony.</i>

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:58.970
<i>Athletes, please enter the arena!</i>

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:03.250
I hereby swear that we,
 the participating athletes,

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:05.430
will show the fruits of our daily training

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:10.560
and run, jump, and perform 
with all of our might!

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:12.190
The 71st

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:12.190
<b>Miyagi Prefecture Inter-High Athletics Tournament</b>

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:12.190
<b>Beautiful
Dance</b>

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:14.650
Meet up here fifteen minutes 
before our start time.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.670
Make sure you warm up properly.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:17.110
<b>Athlete seats</b>

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:17.110
<b>Warm-ups</b>

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:17.110
<b>Main Arena Entrance</b>

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:17.650
Yes, sir!

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:22.450
<b>71st Miyagi Prefecture Inter-High Athletics Tournament
Men's Rhythmic Gymnastics</b>

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:22.450
<b>Miyagi Korin Academy</b>

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:22.450
<b>Score</b>

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:28.230
Is fourteen high or low?

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:31.460
Well... it says a perfect score is twenty.

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:34.920
<i>Competing second: 
Matsushima Minami High School.</i>

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:24.260
Just showing up now?

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:25.300
You're late.

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:28.490
You're the only team worth watching.

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:30.330
Or so I'd like to say...

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:34.730
But I wonder if that's really true.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:37.330
I heard you made it through 
your prefectural tournament.

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:38.570
We did, thank you.

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:41.650
You wait and see what we do with six!

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:45.340
Don't get a big head just because 
you meet the member requirement.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:57.250
Looking good.

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.630
You should be fun to watch.

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:03.890
We'll see if the same goes
 for the other Ao High members.

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:09.640
But I really am looking forward to it.

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:10.780
Mashiro.

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:12.430
Hmm? What is it?

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:13.890
The gym is that way.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:14.890
What?!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.200
Where is Mashiro?!

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:18.550
He's not answering texts again...

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:19.360
I can't believe him!

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.960
<i>What if... because of me...</i>

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:30.390
<i>I have to do this right.</i>

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:39.860
Matsushima Minami just took 
first place with 16.950.

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:43.250
Sendai Tokuou is performing now.

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:47.860
I would expect Sendai Tokuou 
to outplace them.

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:52.220
<i>Competing fifth: Sendai Tokuou High School.</i>

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.540
Sho-chan's school is up after this, right?

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:56.350
Yeah.

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:59.060
It's our first tournament with the six of us.

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:01.980
This is our starting gate.

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:07.340
The sky, fellas!

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:08.910
Let's soar up into the blue!

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.160
Yeah!

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.160
Yah!

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:20.170
Whoa, they're amazing!

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:25.050
Yeah. Even an amateur can see 
the difference from the other schools.

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:39.320
But of course. They <i>are</i> last year's winners.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:44.090
Mind the timing when
 you start the second pass.

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:46.580
Other than that, just do this like always.

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:55.950
<b>71st Miyagi Prefecture Inter-High Athletics Tournament
Men's Rhythmic Gymnastics</b>

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:55.950
<b>Sendai Tokuou High School</b>

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:55.950
<b>Score</b>

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:58.450
<b>71st Miyagi Prefecture Inter-High Athletics Tournament
Men's Rhythmic Gymnastics</b>

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:02.130
They took first?

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.770
Shotaro's up next!

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:06.210
Second place is 16.950.

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:10.340
So they have to beat that score 
to make it to regionals?

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:12.680
Fight for it.

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:14.970
All right! Let's go!

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:16.770
Have fun out there.

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:17.800
Right!

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:22.010
Have fun out there.

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:22.790
Right.

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:23.730
Have fun, okay?

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.110
You got it!

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:26.790
Jump your heart out!

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:27.520
Yah!

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:28.250
Have fun.

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:29.100
Right.

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:48.310
Believe in yourself.

00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:50.970
Follow your feelings and soar.

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:58.100
You have a gift.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:01.840
A gift?

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:04.000
You didn't realize?

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:06.590
Your earnestness.

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:13.240
That's a gift in its own right.

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:19.980
Enjoy being nervous, too.

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:23.750
Right!

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:30.460
<i>Competing sixth: 
Soshukan Private High School.</i>

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:32.510
Ready!

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:42.640
We're almost to Shotaro's greatest weakness.

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:55.470
Yes!

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:10.600
Misa-pon really is good.

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:03.960
Futaba.

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:08.620
Shotaro looked pretty great, didn't he?

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:20.150
<b>Soshukan Private High School</b>

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:21.630
<b>71st Miyagi Prefecture Inter-High Athletics Tournament
Men's Rhythmic Gymnastics</b>

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:21.650
<b>Soshukan Private High School</b>

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:21.650
<b>Score</b>

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:23.610
<b>71st Miyagi Prefecture Inter-High Athletics Tournament
Men's Rhythmic Gymnastics</b>

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:24.610
Yes!

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:27.160
Second? They placed second!

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.710
They made it through?

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:30.790
They're going to regionals!

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:32.920
Pity that.

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:36.420
If not for Onagawa-kun's mistake, 
they could have taken first.

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:39.630
I guess they earned a <i>little</i> bragging rights.

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:42.780
Shotaro Futaba...

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:45.040
Shotaro...

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:52.770
Great job, everyone.

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:54.300
Well done, indeed.

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:56.930
You guys had me worried for a minute there.

00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:59.650
That's my line! 
You're the one who screwed up!

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:01.260
You need more practice! Lots more!

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:02.530
I'm s-sorry!

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:05.360
You're crying again?

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:23.230
<i>We get to soar even more!</i>
